OL,4,Aidentity at protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid McNally, 33, of Winchester Road
OL,7,Fin Portsmouth, was also charged with
OL,8,Fobstructing the highway and attempted
OL,9,Fcriminal damage. He is due in court on
OL,10,F29 October.
